'''Prismatic''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Prismatic Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux in the [[shop]] from July 17th, 2020 to December 13th, 2020. During the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]], it went offsale, but then came back onsale for a short period of time after the event ended. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[Gamepasses|gamepass]] has since went offsale.

==Appearance==
Prismatic is a knife with a black and rainbow color scheme, but however, it is not classified as a chroma. It is curved on the blade and it has three sharp curves jutting out of the bottom near the blade guard and the top near the tip of the blade. The bottom of the handle has a short spike on the end.

==Trivia==  
*[[Nikilis]] hinted towards the release of this knife on his Twitter.
**The tweet can be found [https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/1283866373152636929 here].
*This knife was created due to the hype on Roblox’s [https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Cartoony_Rainbow_(series) Cartoony Rainbow Series] that multiple UGC creators have contributed to.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]].

